{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46892","headline":"荆门寄题禅月大师影堂 · 齐己","name":"荆门寄题禅月大师影堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泽国闻师泥日後，蜀王全礼葬余灰。\n白莲塔向清泉锁，禅月堂临锦水开。\n西岳千篇传古律，南宗一句印灵台。\n不堪只履还西去，葱岭如今无使回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}